cautiousness, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  But for the near-term, dollar-buying interest by Japanese investors on dips, especially at the low-Y120.00 level, will limit the dollar's fall, they said. \par \par \uc2  'The loss-cutting is mostly by short-term players like interbanks and trading companies. Longer-term players are still likely to sell yen,' Sanwa's Hashimoto said. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 03-09-97 \par \par \uc2  0610GMT \par \par \uc2  1074 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt9306fgt\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
