\par\par \b \uc2  Early Tokyo: Dlr Mixed; Market On  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Watch \b0\par\par\uc2 362 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Mai 1997\par 02:22\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO (AP-Dow Jones)--The dollar recovered some of its overnight losses on buying from U.S. investors in early Tokyo trading, leaving the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  mixed compared with its levels late in New York Wednesday, but many investors are still wary of potential \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  'Some people in the market are saying that (\b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) has a target range for the dollar between Y120 and Y125, so there's still a good chance they could \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,' said Terry Terasawa, manager of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading at Bank of Tokyo-Mitsubishi. \par \par \uc2  Fresh concerns were sparked by a Kyodo News Report Wednesday quoting an 'international monetary source' saying that Germany, Japan and the U.S. were standing by, ready to sell dollars in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets. 'International monetary source' is a term senior finance ministry officials use when speaking anonymously about sensitive issues. \par \par \uc2  A trader at a Japanse city bank said participants will hunker down until the end of the week, with tension rising until markets close in New York Friday. \par \par \uc2  'The U.S. Federal Reserve likes to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Friday afternoons, when the market is thin, so no one can relax' until trading in New York winds up Friday, he said. \par \par \uc2  Around 0020 GMT (8:20 p.m. EDT), the dollar is trading at Y124.93, down from Y125.12 around 0001 GMT (8:01 p.m. EDT) and below Y124.97 in New York late Wednesday. The dollar was quoted at Y125.53 late in Tokyo Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is also trading at DM1.7200, lower than DM1.7218 around 0001 GMT and above DM1.7191 late Wednesday in New York. The dollar was at DM1.7245 in Tokyo late Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The mark is trading at Y72.63, down from Y72.67 around 0001 GMT and below Y72.70 in New York late Wednesday. The mark was quoted late in Tokyo Wednesday at Y72.79. \par \par \uc2  Sterling is at $1.6135, down from $1.6154 around 0001 GMT and flat from $1.6135 in New York late Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 08-05-97 \par \par \uc2  0022GMT \par \par \uc2  1074 1863 4162 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt580386h\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
