\par\par \b \uc2  World  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  -2: Newswire Report Sandbags Sterling \b0\par\par\uc2 341 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Mai 1997\par 22:45\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Sterling, thinly traded for most of Wednesday in the aftermath of its rally Tuesday, was heavily sold late in the session. The sell-off came in reaction to a newswire report that quoted 'a senior Labour economic source' as saying 'the new U.K. Labour government may join the European Union's Exchange Rate Mechanism.' \par \par \uc2  The pound lost more than three pfennigs on the report, falling to an intra-day low of 1.6095. \par \par \uc2  'I'm surprised they're reacting that strongly,' said Earl Johnson, \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  economist at Bank of Montreal in Chicago. Traders said there's still a lot of nervousness surrounding sterling in the wake of the Labour Party's smashing victory in the U.K. \par \par \uc2  Larsen at Commerzbank said a number of forces conspired against the dollar Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Overnight, traders were selling long Japanese Japanese government bonds, Larsen said. That, coupled with talk of a possible Japanese interest rate hike and growing \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  fears, sparked unwinding of long dollar positions by traders buying yen. \par \par \uc2  'The threats of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  are keeping a cap on the dollar,' said Johnson at Bank of Montreal. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , if any, would come from the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Johnson said, and would not be a joint effort. \par \par \uc2  Ricardo Gomes, managing director at Republic National Bank of New York, said he was surprised to see any suggestion of Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  appear without the official blessing of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's Finance Ministry, or the Bank of Japan. \par \par \uc2  Nevertheless, he added: 'I wouldn't be surprised to see them doing something tomorrow or Friday.' \par \par \uc2  Chandler at Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is not very likely in the near-term. 'I think the threat of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is, if anything, less plausible than it was a week ago,' Chandler said. \par \par \uc2  Nevertheless, he said, 'I'd say the market is well aware that the Bank of Japan has over $220 billion in external reserves, and that they could sell those dollars.' \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 07-05-97 \par \par \uc2  2045GMT \par \par \uc2  1033 1865 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt57037ma\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
