\par\par \b \uc2  Early Tokyo -2: Dlr Hits New 50-Month High Against Yen \b0\par\par\uc2 290 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 April 1997\par 02:50\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  The dollar hit an intraday high of Y124.90 around 0031 GMT (8:31 p.m. EST), the highest the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been since it traded at Y125.20 on Feb. 2, 1993. That is also the last time the dollar traded above Y125.00. \par \par \uc2  The dollar's strength against the yen has helped to send the Deutsche mark up against the yen, limiting the dollar's movement against the mark. \par \par \uc2  The mark is trading at Y73.91, up from Y73.73 around 0001 GMT and above Y73.74 in New York late Friday. The mark was quoted late in Tokyo Friday at 73.84. \par \par \uc2  A joint declaration from the Asia-Pacific Economic Cooperation finance ministers' meeting in the Philippines over the weekend that major misalignments in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates seen two years ago have been corrected has had minimal impact on the market, traders said. \par \par \uc2  'The statement was exactly what the market expected,' said the U.S. bank trader. \par \par \uc2  The one thing that could get in the way of the dollar's move up against the yen is jawboning from Japanese financial officials. Market participants are wary that rumors of Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  may circulate in the market. \par \par \uc2  While actual dollar-selling by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  could push the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  down temporarily, the wide interest rate differentials between the U.S. and Japan should ensure that the dollar remains well-bid, traders said. \par \par \uc2  Sterling is at $1.6345, up from $1.6342 around 0001 GMT but unchanged from $1.6345 in New York late Friday. Sterling was at $1.6432 in Tokyo late Friday. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 07-04-97 \par \par \uc2  0050GMT \par \par \uc2  1074 4162 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt4702f26\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
