 in January from a revised 52.8 in December, the first time manufacturing growth accelerated since October. \par \par \uc2  Late Monday in New York, sterling was at DM2.6578, up from DM2.6252 late Friday. The British \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was also at Y197.12, up from Y194.55. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 03-02-97 \par \par \uc2  2244GMT \par \par \uc2  1033 1865 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt2300tza\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
