\par\par \b \uc2  World  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2 : Dollar Sinks Further Into Consolidative Funk \b0\par\par\uc2  By Betty W. Liu \par \uc2 268 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Januar 1997\par 22:50\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  NEW YORK (AP-Dow Jones)--The dollar sank further into a consolidative funk Thursday, led by punctuated bouts of profit taking that forced it lower against the yen for the first time this week. \par \par \uc2  The dollar also ended lower against other major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Eisuke Sakakibara, an influential member of Japan's \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2 , reminded \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets that Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the yen is still an option. That caused the first wave of dollar selling in Asia, dragging down the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to just below Y121. \par \par \uc2  A Tokyo news report quoted Sakakibara, famous for tossing the yen about with just a few choice words, as saying the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  could \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the yen when the timing is right. \par \par \uc2  Towards the close of London trading, stop/loss sell orders were triggered, which took the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to its intraday low against the Deutsche mark. \par \par \uc2  'Considering how quickly the dollar went up this year, a correction down below DM1.6000 and Y118 certainly wouldn't be out of the question,' said Steve Jury, chief dealer at Union Bank of Switzerland in New York. 'But the longer term trend is still a higher dollar.' \par \par \uc2  Late Thursday in New York, the dollar was quoted at DM1.6360, down from DM1.6434 late Wednesday in New York. The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was also quoted at Y121.78, down from Y122.05. Sterling was trading at $1.6134, down from $1.6200. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 30-01-97 \par \par \uc2  2150GMT \par \par \uc2  1033 1865 4164 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt1u00olx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
