\par\par \b \uc2  Tokyo Midday/Dlr Down -2: Sees No Outright  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 243 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Januar 1997\par 02:45\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO (AP-Dow Jones)--A local news report quoting \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  (MOF) official Eisuke Sakakibara as saying \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market when the timing is effective sent the dollar lower midday in Tokyo Thursday than its levels early in the session. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  plummeted one yen to an intraday low of Y121.35 from an intraday high of Y122.60 following the remarks, which were reported by Jiji press, traders said. \par \par \uc2  MOF officials weren't immediately available to confirm the comments. \par \par \uc2  But traders said that short-term interbank players and speculators were responsible for the dollar's sharp movement lower. \par \par \uc2  They said it was highly unlikely that Sakakibara's remarks were a precursor to acutal \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BOJ). \par \par \uc2  'There definately wasn't any \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,' said Shuichi Noji, a dealer at Hokkaido Takushoku Bank. \par \par \uc2  Around 0145 GMT, the dollar is trading at Y121.85, down from Y122.20 around 0030 GMT and below 122.05 yen in New York late Wednesday. The dollar was quoted at 121.90 yen in Tokyo late Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is also trading at DM1.6427, lower than DM1.6458 earlier in Tokyo and also below 1.6434 marks late Wednesday in New York. The dollar was at 1.6502 marks in Tokyo late Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 30-01-97 \par \par \uc2  0145GMT \par \par \uc2  1074 1863 4162 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt1u00ned\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
