\par\par \b \uc2  World  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2 : BOJ  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Rumors Spark Market \b0\par\par\uc2  By Betty W. Liu \par \uc2 315 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Januar 1997\par 22:49\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  NEW YORK (AP-Dow Jones)--Unconfirmed rumors that  the Bank of Japan (BOJ) sold dollars for yen Friday provided most of the excitement in a market only too eager to get a weekend rest. \par \par \uc2  Toward the close of Asian trading, rumors spread quickly that \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 , sending the dollar tumbling more than one yen from its 47-month peak. A BOJ spokesman wouldn't comment. \par \par \uc2  Bargain hunting helped the dollar recoup some losses although it still ended lower against the yen and most other major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The BOJ probably \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on a 'very low key basis. It's more for image than for substance,' said Dennis Pettit, vice president, \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Long-Term Credit Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 . 'It's best not to be seen \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the opposite direction of the market because you're immediately giving yourself a difficult task.' \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the uncertainty surrounding the rumored BOJ action is exactly what's keeping many traders away from trading dollar/yen too much in favor of trading yen against other \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  such as the mark or sterling. \par \par \uc2  Indeed, the dollar hovered tightly around 119 yen Friday while the mark made chunky gains against the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  before succumbing to a late dose of profit-taking. \par \par \uc2  'In the last 48 hours, there's been demand for mark/yen... because it's a dollar neutral play,' said Pettit. \par \par \uc2  Late Friday in New York, the dollar was quoted at DM1.6284, down from DM1.6326 late Thursday in New York. The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was also quoted at Y118.98, down from Y119.31, after hitting Y120.13, a level not seen since Feb. 17, 1993 when it hit Y120.25. \par \par \uc2  Sterling was trading at $1.6302, down from $1.6320. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 24-01-97 \par \par \uc2  2149GMT \par \par \uc2  1033 1865 4164 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt1o00ifs\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
